  "native_scope": "External AX on synthetic host only (menu bar excluded). Foreground-guarded HID left-button events open native menus; focused Space/Down/Return changes active Library; Escape dismisses; native Google and Library Settings items reach fixture callbacks. Each open asserts popup bottom above trigger top. No permission changes.",
  "limitations": [
    "Human VoiceOver speech and end-user physical keyboard navigation remain manual review.",
    "No database, account or package mutation exists in this fixture. Async access/projection races remain specified future furnaces.",
    "Cloud authentication is simulated. Google action records supported-path intent; unsigned case disables it."
  ],
  "failed_attempts": [
    "Initial AX label probe used description only; corrected to include native title/help/value.",
    "Initial traversal included native application menu bar; scope corrected to exclude it, superseded output discarded.",
    "First native keyboard test delivered keys but did not prove selection; kept as failure.",
    "Down navigation proved Studio selected. Explicit menu dismissal plus settling and actual bound-selection assertion produced final pass; stale AX menu children alone are not a dismissal oracle.",
    "NSPopUpButton preferredEdge did not place the menu above on this macOS build; replaced with native NSMenu.popUp anchored to NSButton.",
    "An intermediate run stopped on foreground loss. AXPress activation intermittently returned timeout or no menu; final context matrix uses native HID left-click and separate keyboard activation."
  ],
  "discarded": "Superseded Library-name-trigger variants, initial navigation/management capture set, old review report and redundant raw diagnostics removed before publication. Current management captures are from the same final accepted full run; concise failed-attempt history retained here.",
